    %%field Encounter.ended_at help: When they finished. Empty while the encounter is open.
    %%field Encounter.chief_complaint help: What the patient came in about, in their own words.
    %%field Encounter.is_billable help: Whether this contact generates an invoice. A ward review inside an admission usually does not.
