    %%field Admission.bed_id help: The bed they are in now. Changes when they are transferred.
    %%field Admission.admission_type help: How they came in, which drives priority and reporting.
    %%field Admission.status help: Where the stay has got to.
    %%field Admission.admitted_at help: When the bed was taken.
    %%field Admission.expected_discharge_date help: The working estimate, used for bed planning.
