    %%field VitalSign.encounter_id help: The contact these observations were taken during.
    %%field VitalSign.staff_id help: Who took them.
    %%field VitalSign.recorded_at help: When they were taken — not when they were typed in.
    %%field VitalSign.temperature_c help: Body temperature in degrees Celsius.
    %%field VitalSign.pulse_bpm help: Heart rate in beats per minute.
    %%field VitalSign.systolic_bp help: Systolic blood pressure in millimetres of mercury.
    %%field VitalSign.diastolic_bp help: Diastolic blood pressure in millimetres of mercury.
    %%field VitalSign.respiratory_rate help: Breaths per minute.
    %%field VitalSign.oxygen_saturation help: Peripheral oxygen saturation as a percentage.
    %%field VitalSign.early_warning_score help: The aggregate score these observations produce. Above the escalation threshold it means call someone.
