    %%field Diagnosis.encounter_id help: The contact this conclusion was reached in.
    %%field Diagnosis.staff_id help: The clinician who recorded it and is accountable for it.
    %%field Diagnosis.diagnosis_code help: The classification code, from whichever coding standard the hospital uses. What billing and reporting key on.
    %%field Diagnosis.description help: The diagnosis in words, as it should read on a letter.
    %%field Diagnosis.diagnosis_type help: Whether this is the main reason for the contact or something recorded alongside it.
    %%field Diagnosis.diagnosed_at help: When it was recorded.
    %%field Diagnosis.is_chronic help: Whether this is a long-term condition rather than something arising from this contact. Chronic diagnoses carry forward.
    %%field Diagnosis.diagnosis_type enum: DiagnosisType
