    %%field Procedure.encounter_id help: The contact this was done during.
    %%field Procedure.doctor_id help: The doctor who performed it and is accountable for it.
    %%field Procedure.procedure_code help: The classification code, which is what billing prices from.
    %%field Procedure.name help: What was done, in words.
    %%field Procedure.status help: Where the procedure has got to. Driven by the procedure lifecycle rather than typed in.
    %%field Procedure.scheduled_for help: When it is planned for. Empty for something done there and then.
    %%field Procedure.performed_at help: When it was actually done. Empty until it is.
    %%field Procedure.anaesthetic_type help: What anaesthetic was used, if any.
    %%field Procedure.outcome help: What happened, including any complications.
