    %%field Consent.procedure_id help: The procedure being consented to.
    %%field Consent.consent_type help: How consent was given and recorded.
    %%field Consent.giver_type help: In what capacity consent was given — the patient themselves, or someone entitled to consent on their behalf.
    %%field Consent.giver_name help: The name of the person who consented, as they signed it.
    %%field Consent.witnessed_by_id help: The member of staff who witnessed it. Required, because an unwitnessed consent is not a consent.
    %%field Consent.consented_at help: When it was given.
    %%field Consent.is_withdrawn help: Consent can be withdrawn at any time up to the procedure, and withdrawal must be as easy to record as consent was.
    %%field Consent.withdrawn_at help: When it was withdrawn. Empty unless it was.
    %%field Consent.notes help: What was explained, and anything the patient asked.
    %%field Consent.consent_type enum: ConsentType
