    %%action refuseNonPositivePayment validation-error when: amount <= 0 message: A payment must be for a positive amount. A refund is not recorded here.
    %%action refuseOverpayment validation-error when: amount > outstandingBefore message: That is more than this bill still owes. Check the amount, or apply the balance to another invoice.

